[30.948623125,"o","\r\u001b[2K● All 3 backend tests passed: lists the todos, rejects a todo without a\r\n  title, and adds, completes and deletes a todo.\r\n\r\n  I ran them in stackctl's \u001b[94mtest\u001b[0m mode, which has its own ports and\r\n  database, so your development data wasn't touched. No test session was\r\n  running beforehand, so I started one for the backend, ran \u001b[94mstackctl\r\n  --mode test run backend test\u001b[0m, and then quit the session.\r\n\r\n"]
